{"2717010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KALPA: Cosmic Symphony", "steam_appid": 2717010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4938050, 4337140, 4724940, 4124270, 4050040, 4240410, 4872170, 4580750, 3295260, 3290790, 3600870, 3864680, 4108350, 3864670, 4290630, 4290620, 3616790, 4489600, 4938050], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beautiful characters, a grand story, and an incredible soundtrack.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A next-generation story-driven rhythm game where your performance dictates the fate of the world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/8045331842a89ce912936548f1458884.poster.avif?t=1785151510\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/8045331842a89ce912936548f1458884.webm?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/8045331842a89ce912936548f1458884.mp4?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ A new experience where the story meets rhythm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「KALPA: Cosmic Symphony」 is a next-generation rhythm game crafted with beautiful characters, a vast story, and a diverse range of music and ways to play them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and experience the moment your performance changes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/da7fb813113d4594989f2649e8bd4131.poster.avif?t=1785151510\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/da7fb813113d4594989f2649e8bd4131.webm?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/da7fb813113d4594989f2649e8bd4131.mp4?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Charming Characters and an In-Depth Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of beautiful and charming characters, each with their own unique personalities and backstories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-fledged story chapters of exceptional quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own player avatar and more with characters featured in the story though the 「Companion」feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/372afdcf01f5cd9d4c3aece39812ac57.avif?t=1785151510\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ A Massive Tracklist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring original songs from renowned composers, exclusive to KALPA, alongside legendary fan-favorites that will be familiar to any rhythm game enthusiast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're new to KALPA or a seasoned veteran, you'll find plenty to enjoy with rhythm game classics and hit songs like <strong>'PUPA (Endorfin. Remix)', 'Brain Power', ‘Rainy Waltz’, 'L2 -Reminiscence-', 'Halcyon', ‘Altale’, '</strong>Sound Chimera<strong>’, ‘キミとボクへの葬送歌’, 'Giselle',</strong> <strong>'INFiNiTE ENERZY -Overdoze-'</strong> .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, numerous talented artists who have made their mark global rhythm game scene, such as [TORIENA], [USAO], [ミツキヨ], [xi], [Nauts] have contributed to provide an even richer musical experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/06b2e308cc26ec8c241545ffede48d60.poster.avif?t=1785151510\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/06b2e308cc26ec8c241545ffede48d60.webm?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/06b2e308cc26ec8c241545ffede48d60.mp4?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ A Variety of Play Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KALPA’s diverse range of modes provides a constant stream of new fun, ensuring every player can find a style that's perfect for them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Dive into a unique experience where narrative and music intertwine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play:</strong> Play any song you want freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Play together with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Random Match:</strong> Experience the joy of encountering new songs and players through random selections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Ladder Match:</strong> Compete and improve through the Ghost Ranking System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astra Mode:</strong> Face the ultimate stage for endless challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/3f7e424aacd4641cd233b242ea016b80.avif?t=1785151510\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Introducing Astra Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Composer Charts:</strong> Play charts created by the very artists who composed the music for KALPA.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranker Charts:</strong> Challenge yourself with charts designed by rankers recognized for their skill in other rhythm games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content That Grows with the Community:</strong> By involving not only our development team but also key figures from the rhythm game scene, we've added a new level of depth and quality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/797e7b0fd539b9fae5a495ea57072f11.poster.avif?t=1785151510\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/797e7b0fd539b9fae5a495ea57072f11.webm?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717010/extras/797e7b0fd539b9fae5a495ea57072f11.mp4?t=1785151510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ The KALPA Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experience that goes beyond mere score-chasing, where the performance itself drives the story forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosmic fantasy woven together with charming characters, grand visuals, and a symphonic OST.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A moment where your choices and your performance will change the fate of the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the moment your performance becomes the final melody.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beautiful characters, a grand story, 